OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FGenerally fine and dry on Sunday with
OL,7,Fwinds easing. Rain and low cloud early
OL,8,Fon Monday, easing in the afternoon.
OL,9,FFurther rain Tuesday morning, then
OL,10,Fmostly dry with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
